# ============================================================
# BatteryNode_Flow.graph
# Unity Visual Scripting  –  FlowGraph Node Specification
#
# ARCHITECTURE CONTRACT:
#   Mathf.Max/Min in Drain()/Charge() stay in C#.
#   VS reads ChargeRatio and HasCharge for threshold reactions.
#
# NODE MAP:
#   [Update] → [GetComponent<BatteryNode>]
#     → [GetMember: ChargeRatio] → float
#     → [Branch: ChargeRatio <= 0.25 AND prevRatio > 0.25]
#       True → [Trigger Custom Event "OnBatteryLow"]
#     → [Branch: ChargeRatio <= 0.0 AND prevRatio > 0.0]
#       True → [Trigger Custom Event "OnBatteryDepleted"]
#   [Set Variable: prevRatio = ChargeRatio]
#
# CUSTOM EVENTS:
#   "OnBatteryLow"       → flash low-power warning on HUD
#   "OnBatteryDepleted"  → trigger emergency shutdown sequence
#
# MACHINE SETUP:
#   ScriptMachine on building prefab root alongside BatteryNode
# ============================================================